# Wolt Ops Analytics Project

This project is a complete **Operations & Product Analytics portfolio project** inspired by the real job role at **Wolt / Delivery Hero**.  
It demonstrates end-to-end analytics skills including data cleaning, modeling, dashboarding, SQL, experimentation, and performance measurement.

The goal of this project is to replicate the type of analytical work performed by analysts working in **Quick Commerce (Q-Commerce), Dmarts, Logistics, Delivery Operations, and Growth Product teams**.

---

## 📊 Project Overview

This project uses real-world-style operational data with metrics such as:

- City & market data  
- Orders, cancellations, complaints  
- Delivery time performance  
- Revenue & ratings  
- Courier supply and earnings  
- Restaurant & courier activity  
- Operational targets  
- Week-by-week operational performance

The final output includes:

- **Complete SQL data model**
- **One-page Looker-style operational dashboard**
- **Insights for ops & product management teams**
- **Documentation on how to reproduce the analysis**

---

## 🧱 Dataset Structure

The main dataset contains:

| Column | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `city_id` | Unique city identifier |
| `city_name` | Name of the city |
| `market_tier` | Market classification (Tier 1/2/3) |
| `population` | Population of the city |
| `week_start` | Start date of the week |
| `total_orders` | Total orders placed |
| `cancelled_orders` | Cancelled orders |
| `complaints` | Customer complaints |
| `avg_delivery_mins` | Average delivery time |
| `total_revenue` | Weekly revenue |
| `avg_rating` | Customer rating |
| `active_restaurants` | Active merchants |
| `active_couriers` | Courier supply |
| `avg_courier_earnings` | Earnings per courier |
| `target_avg_delivery_mins` | SLA delivery target |
| `target_cancellation_rate` | Expected cancellation SLA |

---

## 🛠 Tech Stack

- **SQL (BigQuery-style)**
- **Python (Pandas / Analysis notebooks)**
- **Looker / BI Dashboard Style**
- **GitHub for version control**

---

## 📈 One-Page Dashboard (Looker Style)

The dashboard includes:

### **1. KPI Summary**
- Order volume  
- SLA performance  
- Cancellation rate  
- Revenue & AOV  
- Courier supply health  
- Merchant availability  

### **2. Delivery Performance Analysis**
- Avg delivery time vs target  
- Last 8-week trend  
- Delay causes  

### **3. Cancellations & Complaints**
- Root-cause analysis  
- City-level breakdown  

### **4. Supply (Couriers) & Demand Balance**
- Active couriers  
- Earnings  
- Supply–demand gap analysis  

### **5. City-Level Heatmap**
- Identify underperforming cities  
- Priority action areas  

